            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "After 812917c this now should work for 'selection=exclusive'. For combination of 'virtualedit=all' and 'selection=inclusive' collapsing multline regions doesn't work for technical reasons ([read here more](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/2435d0de00174a45d6b352fefeaa6008ebe9f23b/lua/mini/ai.lua#L1037-L1041)). There *is*a solution, but it is a bit clumsy and potentially expensive/breaking, so I don't think worth it in this particular case.",
